<title>USA: TJX Cos Feb same-store sales rose 5 pct.</title>
<headline>TJX Cos Feb same-store sales rose 5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRAMINGHAM, Mass 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>TJX Cos Inc on Thursday said February same-store sales rose five percent while total sales for the four-week period ended March 1, 1997, rose five percent to $436 million from $416 million for the four weeks ended March 2, 1996.</p>
</text>
